 J Mol Med||11|683||bib12|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12736707</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kim</surname><given-names>JY</given-names></name><name><surname>Ahn</surname><given-names>HJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Ryu</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name><name><surname>Suk</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Park</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>BH3-only protein Noxa is a mediator of hypoxic cell death induced by hypoxia-inducible factor 1 alpha</article-title><source>J Exp Med</source><year>2004</year><volume>199</volume><fpage>113</fpage><lpage>124</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Exp Med||199|113||bib13|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14699081</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kitamura</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Shimizu</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Ito</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Tanaka</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Emi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Allelotyping of follicular thyroid carcinoma: frequent allelic losses in chromosome arms 7q, 11p, and 22q</article-title><source>J Clin Endocrinol Metab</source><year>2001</year><volume>86</volume><fpage>4268</fpage><lpage>4272</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Clin Endocrinol Metab||86|4268||bib14|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11549660</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kotani</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Detheux</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Vandenbogaerde</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Comm